  "LongDescription": "​PRAN Naga Chilli Pickle 300g is a fiery condiment crafted from freshly harvested Naga chillies, renowned for their intense heat and distinctive flavor. Blended with aromatic spices and preserved in oil, this pickle delivers a bold, spicy kick that enhances any meal. Its vibrant red hue and chunky texture make it visually appealing and appetizing. Whether paired with rice, paratha, or snacks, it adds an electrifying zest to your dishes. Produced by PRAN Agro Ltd. in Bangladesh, this pickle is a must-have for spice enthusiasts seeking authentic taste. ​",
